  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme for Country Partnership for Cambodia (2026-2028)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Upon conclusion of the PCP 2018-2023, the Government of Cambodia requested UNIDO to continue the collaboration under the PCP framework for a new cycle, aligned with the UNSCDF. The next phase of PCP 2026-2028 is to contribute to achievement of the national development framework - the Pentagon Strategy Phase I - and other national policies for development to reach Cambodia#s industrial development goals and industrialization and amplify its economic diversification and competitiveness.</narrative>
  </description>
